        <p>📧 <a href="mailto:info@teamtastic.events">info@teamtastic.events</a><br />
        🌐 <a href="https://www.teamtastic.events" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.teamtastic.events</a></p>
        
        <blockquote>
          <p><em>Because every holiday is a chance to bring your team closer together.</em></p>
